&CONTROL CMS
*
* Build decNumber as static library on and for CMS370.
*
* Based on ../build.sh.
*

&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE

* Compile decNumber.
*   Skip DNBASIC  as it's for inclusion in other source files.
*   Skip DNCOMMON as it's for inclusion in other source files.
EXEC GCC DNCTXT   ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DNNUMBER ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DN32     ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DN64     ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DN128    ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DNSINGLE ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DNDOUBLE ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DNQUAD   ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT
EXEC GCC DNPACKED ( CMS PARM DNGCC CSECT

* Make static lib DECNUM TXTLIB.
TXTLIB GEN DECNUM DNCTXT DNDOUBLE DNNUMBER DN128 DN32 DN64 DNPACKED DNQUAD DNSINGLE
